  <div class="page-shell"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Disclaimer'}]} /><header class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Independent project</p><h1>Independent-project disclaimer.</h1><p class="lead">FM AI Assistent is a third-party community project. It is not an official Football Manager product.</p></header><section class="section content-grid"><article class="prose"><h2>No affiliation or endorsement</h2><p>FM AI Assistent is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by or otherwise connected to Sports Interactive or SEGA. No official partnership, Football Manager API relationship or approval is claimed.</p><h2>Trademarks</h2><p>Football Manager and related names and marks belong to their respective owners. Their use on this site identifies compatibility and the subject of the companion application; it does not claim ownership or endorsement.</p><h2>Decision support</h2><p>Application output and AI responses are informational aids. RAM-decoded data can be incomplete or stale, and generative AI can be wrong. Verify recommendations, prices, availability, rules and outcomes inside the game.</p><h2>Distribution and source</h2><p>Use only the <a href={site.releases} rel="noopener noreferrer">official repository’s release page</a> for downloads. The repository is publicly viewable, but the current checkout has no license file; public visibility alone does not grant open-source reuse rights.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>AI providers, GitHub and any linked documentation operate under their own terms and privacy practices. Their availability, prices, model catalogs and limits can change independently of this project.</p></article><aside class="info-card"><h3>Project links</h3><p><a class="text-link" href={site.repository} rel="noopener noreferrer">Source repository →</a></p><p><a class="text-link" href={site.releaseNotes} rel="noopener noreferrer">Release notes →</a></p><p><a class="text-link" href={site.issues} rel="noopener noreferrer">Report an issue →</a></p></aside></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
